here. Jolene also uses candles to create a calming space during her yoga sessions.\n\n2. **Essential Oils**: Both Deborah and Jolene incorporate essential oils into their practice. Deborah uses them to enhance her yoga experience, while Jolene finds calm when she meditates with essential oils.\n\n3. **Music**: Deborah finds instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rhythms helpful for her yoga practice, contributing to a peaceful environment.\n\n4. **Mindful Breathing**: Deborah recommends mindful breathing as a technique to enhance yoga practice, which Jolene is also seeking advice on.\n\n5. **Gentle Yoga Flow**: Deborah suggested a gentle yoga flow focused on breathing and grounding to help Jolene cope with stress.\n\n6. **Environment**: Deborah believes that the environment can enhance the practice, indicating the importance of a peaceful and supportive setting for yoga.\n\nThese elements collectively contribute to a more enriching and calming yoga experience for both Deborah and Jolene.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah bought the candle to improve her yoga practice. (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Deborah finds instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rhythms helpful for yoga practice (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Deborah uses essential oils in her yoga practice (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Jolene has recently been engaging in yoga. (event_time: 2023-08-26T17:33:00Z)\n  - Deborah inquires about how meditation has been helping Jolene. (event_time: 2023